  "qualification": "One fresh canonical Vite site compile, exact canonical manifest write statement and production pure account route generator; no complete CMS/article/SEO pipeline or deployment. Current public HTTP fallback only. Mobile oracle verifies RU/EN flags, same main node, locale routes/canonical/returnTo/hash,44px flag targets, no horizontal overflow, no globe/CMS/analytics and unavailable deletion guard. Preflight/package metadata, missing manifest, inappropriate sitemap writer and no-test selector failures remain separate; compiler was retained without repetition. Actual mobile case passed once. Original producer failed afterwards by counting four duplicated Playwright attachment copies as extra captures; its false aggregate is retained, with this scoped ROOT derivation from original browser/source/output reports. Tool package metadata and observed compiled module bytes are bound, not an exhaustive installed dependency closure.",
